msgstr "O sistema de grutas"

#. Key:	Level.8.Description
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(405)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(405)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.8.Description"
msgid "Un enchevêtrement de grottes humides, éclairées çà et là par de vieilles lampes de mine. Des Deathmoths nichent au plafond, attirées par la moindre lumière."
msgstr "Um emaranhado de grutas húmidas, iluminadas aqui e ali por velhas lâmpadas de mina. As Deathmoths fazem ninho no teto, atraídas pela mais pequena luz."

#. Key:	Level.8.ClassText
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(407)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(407)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.8.ClassText"
msgid "Classe 4 : Dangereux - Entités nombreuses"
msgstr "Classe 4: Perigoso - Muitas entidades"

#. Key:	Note.L8.1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(433)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(433)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Note.L8.1"
msgid "Les papillons. Énormes. Ils viennent vers la lumière. Éteins ta lampe quand tu entends les ailes."
msgstr "As traças. Enormes. Vêm em direção à luz. Apaga a lanterna quando ouvires as asas."

#. Key:	Note.L8.2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(434)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(434)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Note.L8.2"
msgid "Une échelle remonte vers la surface. Il fait nuit là-haut. Toujours nuit."
msgstr "Uma escada sobe de volta à superfície. Lá em cima é noite. Sempre noite."

#. Key:	Level.9.Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(444)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(444)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.9.Title"
msgid "The Suburbs"
msgstr "The Suburbs"

#. Key:	Level.9.Nickname
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(445)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(445)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.9.Nickname"
msgid "La banlieue"
msgstr "Os subúrbios"

#. Key:	Level.9.Description
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(446)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(446)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.9.Description"
msgid "Un quartier résidentiel sans fin, plongé dans une nuit éternelle. Les lampadaires grésillent, les maisons sont vides. Ne restez pas dans la rue."
msgstr "Um bairro residencial sem fim, mergulhado numa noite eterna. Os candeeiros crepitam, as casas estão vazias. Não fiques na rua."

#. Key:	Level.9.ClassText
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(448)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(448)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.9.ClassText"
msgid "Classe 4 : Dangereux la nuit"
msgstr "Classe 4: Perigoso à noite"

#. Key:	Note.L9.1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(474)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(474)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Note.L9.1"
msgid "Certaines maisons ont la porte entrouverte. Derrière l'une d'elles, j'ai vu un champ de blé en plein jour."
msgstr "Algumas casas têm a porta entreaberta. Atrás de uma delas, vi um campo de trigo em pleno dia."

#. Key:	Note.L9.2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(475)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(475)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Note.L9.2"
msgid "Les lampadaires ne te protègent pas. Ils te rendent juste plus visible."
msgstr "Os candeeiros não te protegem. Só te tornam mais visível."

#. Key:	Level.10.Title
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(485)
#: Source/Backrooms/Private/BRLevels.cpp(485)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BR,Level.10.Title"
msgid "Field of Wheat"
msgstr "Field of Wheat"

